  "title": "GameStop Announces Release Date for Fourth Quarter and Fiscal Year 2025 Results",
  "summary": "GRAPEVINE, Texas--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- GameStop Corp. (NYSE: GME) (“GameStop” or the “Company”) today announced that it will report its fourth quarter and fiscal year 2025 results after the market closes on Tuesday, March 24, 2026. GameStop Corp. Investor Relations (817) 424-2001 ir@gamestop.com Source: GameStop Corp.",
